       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. FULL-OUTPUT-PROBE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PROBE-FILE ASSIGN TO DYNAMIC PROBE-PATH
               ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS PROBE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD PROBE-FILE.
       01 PROBE-RECORD PIC X.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PROBE-PATH PIC X(4096).
       01 PROBE-STATUS PIC XX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           ACCEPT PROBE-PATH FROM ENVIRONMENT 'FULL_PATH'
           OPEN OUTPUT PROBE-FILE
           MOVE 'X' TO PROBE-RECORD
           WRITE PROBE-RECORD
           CLOSE PROBE-FILE
           MOVE 4 TO RETURN-CODE
           GOBACK.
